all available over the counter, no prescription needed. You'll need one 238

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.120
gram bottle of

6
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:20.300
MiraLAX powder, two to four Dulcolax laxative tablets, and 64 ounces of a clear

7
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:20.880
sports drink

8
00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:25.890
like Gatorade Propel or Crystal Light. That's usually two 32-ounce bottles. If you

9
00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:26.800
have diabetes,

10
