12
00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:37.280
One important rule, your sports drink cannot be red, orange, blue, or purple.

13
00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:43.360
Stick to clear or light colored flavors. The day before your colonoscopy, you

14
00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:43.920
'll start by

15
00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:48.910
mixing the solution. Pour the entire bottle of MiraLAX into a pitcher with all

16
00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:49.840
64 ounces of

17
00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:54.320
the sports drink. Stir or shake until the powder is completely dissolved. You

18
00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:54.880
can chill it in the

19
00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:59.840
refrigerator if you'd like, keeping it cold makes it easier to drink. Now for

20
00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:00.720
part one,

21
00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:06.000
the evening before your procedure. At 5 p.m., take your Dulcolax tablets with a

22
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.120
