23
00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:10.960
Your doctor's instructions will tell you whether to take two or four. Follow

24
00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:11.840
their guidance on the

25
00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:16.010
specific amount. At 6 p.m., you'll start drinking the first half of the

26
00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:18.400
