29
00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:28.800
after you finish. For part two, six hours before your colonoscopy, you'll drink

30
00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:29.520
the second half,

31
00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:34.510
which is another 32 ounces. Drink this at the same pace, an eight ounce glass

32
00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:35.600
every 15 minutes.

33
00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:39.340
You can continue to have clear liquids up until four hours before your

34
00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:40.160
