even if you're already passing clear liquid. I know it can feel like enough,

38
00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:50.000
but finishing

39
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.490
the entire dose is what gives us the clearest view during your procedure. If

40
00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:54.720
the prep isn't

41
00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:59.680
completed as directed, we may need to reschedule, and neither of us wants that.

42
00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:00.480
Please drink plenty

43
00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:04.720
of liquids throughout the process to prevent dehydration. Staying hydrated will

44
00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:05.440
help you feel

